  "description": "Text generation on ONNX Runtime GenAI 0.17.1 behind a Starling adapter: model loading with explicit provider selection (no silent fallback, TF32 off by default), runtime config overlays, reference-counted disposal, and an owned decode loop over pre-tokenized ids (greedy or seeded sampling, max new tokens, stop token ids and stop strings, streaming with UTF-8-safe incremental detokenization through the owned tokenizer Starlings.Tokenizers, cancellation between decode steps, usage accounting). References only Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntimeGenAI.Managed: the application adds Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntimeGenAI (CPU) or Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntimeGenAI.Cuda. Maturity is per model profile (Stable, Preview or Experimental): see the README, generated from the model registry.",
